### CLI Basics ###

tree                                               # All available commands
<command> ?                                        # Help (or Tab)
<command> | grep <pattern>                         # Filter output
show [full-configuration] | grep -f <pattern>      # Filter config, keep context
print tablesize                                    # Used vs max table sizes
sudo <global|vdom> <diag|exec|show|get> ...        # Run global/VDOM command from anywhere


### Factory Reset ###

exec factoryreset                                  # Wipe whole config
exec factoryreset-shutdown                         # Wipe and power off
exec factoryreset2                                 # Keep admin, interfaces, static routes
exec factoryreset keepvmlicense                    # Keep VM license


